          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹦鹉螺的外壳是对数螺线，只有第 2 周讲到它。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "w2-spiral--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "w2-spiral--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "w2-spiral--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对数螺线在极坐标中写作 r = a·e^(bθ)。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "w2-teacher--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "w2-teacher--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "w2-teacher--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "教师专用的提示：先在黑板上画一条阿基米德螺线做对比，学生常把两种螺线混为一谈。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
